===============================================================================
# 1. SYSTEM HEALTH & VERIFICATION
===============================================================================

### Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json


===============================================================================
# 2. AUTHENTICATION MODULE (/api/auth)
===============================================================================

### 2.1 Login - Student Account (Public)
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "etudiant@ynov.com",
  "password": "StudentPassword123!"
}

### 2.2 Login - Admin Account (Public)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amine.fatih@ynov.com",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### 2.3 Login - RH Account (Public)
# @name loginRH
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rh@ynov.com",
  "password": "RhPassword123!"
}

### 2.4 Login - Parent Account (Public)
# @name loginParent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "parent@ynov.com",
  "password": "ParentPassword123!"
}

### 2.5 Request Password Reset (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "etudiant@ynov.com"
}

### 2.6 User Logout (Public / Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json


===============================================================================
# 3. USER MANAGEMENT & ROLES MODULE (/api/users & /api/roles)
===============================================================================

### 3.1 Get All Users (Auth: Admin / RH / Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Create New User / Parent (Auth: Admin / RH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/create
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nouveau.parent@ynov.com",
  "password": "ParentPassword123!",
  "displayName": "Karim Bennani (Parent)",
  "role": "parent",
  "department": "Famille",
  "childrenUids": [
    "STUDENT_UID_HERE"
  ]
}

### 3.3 Create New Student User (Auth: Admin / RH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/create
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nouveau.etudiant@ynov.com",
  "password": "StudentPassword123!",
  "displayName": "Sara Bennani (Étudiante)",
  "role": "student",
  "department": "Informatique"
}

### 3.4 Assign / Change User Role Custom Claim (Auth: Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "TARGET_USER_UID_HERE",
  "role": "rh"
}

### 3.5 Link Parent Account to Student Account (Auth: Admin / RH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/link-parent-student
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentUid": "{{parentUid}}",
  "studentUid": "{{studentUid}}"
}

### 3.6 Get Linked Children Profiles (Auth: Parent / Admin / RH)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/my-children
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Accept: application/json


===============================================================================
# 4. ABSENCE MANAGEMENT MODULE (/api/absences)
===============================================================================

### 4.1 Submit New Absence Request (Auth: Student / Employee)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/absences
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "medical",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-09-02T18:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Consultation médicale spécialisée et repos prescrit",
  "justificationUrl": "http://localhost:9000/ynov-absences/documents/certificat_medical.pdf"
}

### 4.2 Submit Absence Request - Family Reason Example
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/absences
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "family",
  "startDate": "2026-09-10T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-09-10T18:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Événement familial urgent"
}

### 4.3 Get My Absence History (Auth: Student / Employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/my
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Get Linked Children's Absences (Auth: Parent / Admin / RH)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/children
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.5 Get Pending Absence Requests for Review (Auth: Admin / RH / Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{rhToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.6 Get All Absences List (Auth: Admin / RH / Manager / Teacher)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/absences
Authorization: Bearer {{rhToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.7 Get All Absences with Filters (Auth: Admin / RH / Manager / Teacher)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/absences?status=pending&type=medical
Authorization: Bearer {{rhToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.8 Review Absence - Approve Request (Auth: Admin / RH / Manager)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/{{absenceId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{rhToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "reviewNotes": "Certificat médical vérifié et conforme aux exigences."
}

### 4.9 Review Absence - Reject Request (Auth: Admin / RH / Manager)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/{{absenceId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{rhToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "reviewNotes": "Justificatif illisible ou périmé. Merci de téléverser un nouveau document."
}

### 4.10 Delete Pending Absence Request (Auth: Owner Student / Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/absences/{{absenceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


===============================================================================
# 5. DOCUMENT UPLOAD MODULE (/api/documents)
===============================================================================

### 5.1 Upload Justification Document (Auth: Student / Employee)
# Note: In REST Client / Postman, select body format multipart/form-data with key "file".
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BoundaryExample

--BoundaryExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="certificat_medical.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample_justification.pdf
--BoundaryExample--


===============================================================================
# 6. IN-APP NOTIFICATIONS MODULE (/api/notifications)
===============================================================================

### 6.1 Get My In-App Notifications (Auth: Any User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Mark Single Notification as Read (Auth: Notification Owner)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 Mark All Notifications as Read (Auth: Any User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
